| riscos-mesa DispmanX compatibility test, window mode: double-click to run. The
| same Raspberry Pi style program (ES 2.0) as dmx-es1/dmx-es2, but libbcm_host shows
| its "display" in a 640-pixel-wide desktop window, so it multitasks. It runs
| for 5 seconds, then saves its results in this directory (closing the
| window sooner ends it without them).
Dir <Obey$Dir>
Unset DispmanX$Display
Run dmxtest -2 -o dmx-window2
